            <p><h5>Why choose us?</h5></p>
            <ul class="alt">
                <li>We only use FAA examiners that we know and have a relationship with.<br/>
                    Some schools and instructors will try and schedule with the first available instructor. We take the time to plan and schedule your
                    training to align with an examiner that we trust to be fair. 
                </li>
                <li>Custom Study Material<br/>
                    We have our own inhouse training material that is included with instruction. We present this material to you in the same order
                    that you are likely to encounter it during a check ride. This helps to reenforce your knowledge and increase your chance of success.
                    <a href="/PPFT-Vspeeds.pdf" target="_blank" class="button primary icon solid fa-download">Take a look</a>
                </li>
                <li>Foreign Student?<br/>
                    Are you a foreign student that thought you needed to go to a "Flight School" to handle your TSA security check? Think again. We can help.</li>
            </ul>

        </div>
